{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "五类签名",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 124.54,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "钓鱼签名，是诱导你签下一个授权，把资产的控制权交给攻击者。",
   "spoken": "钓鱼签名，是诱导你签下一个授权，把资产的控制权交给攻击者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 3.191,
   "speechEnd": 8.452
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "你签的是真名，私钥也一直在你手里。",
   "spoken": "你签的是真名，私钥也一直在你手里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 8.84,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speechStart": 8.933,
   "speechEnd": 11.805
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "打个比方，骗子拿来一张快递签收单，请你签个字。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，骗子拿来一张快递签收单，请你签个字。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 12.26,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 12.355,
   "speechEnd": 16.369
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "签收单背面印着，同意把房门钥匙交给持单人。",
   "spoken": "签收单背面印着，同意把房门钥匙交给持单人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 16.8,
   "dur": 4.16,
   "speechStart": 16.8,
   "speechEnd": 20.735
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立，签收单可以翻过来看。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立，签收单可以翻过来看。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 21.18,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 21.28,
   "speechEnd": 24.344
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "钱包里的签名请求，常常只显示一串十六进制数据。",
   "spoken": "钱包里的签名请求，常常只显示一串十六进制数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 24.76,
   "dur": 4.32,
   "speechStart": 24.851,
   "speechEnd": 28.847
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "最容易被滥用的签名，有五类。",
   "spoken": "最容易被滥用的签名，有五类。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 29.3,
   "dur": 2.56,
   "speechStart": 29.394,
   "speechEnd": 31.66
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "第一类，approve，允许对方转走你某个代币，最多到一个额度。",
   "spoken": "第一类，approve，允许对方转走你某个代币，最多到一个额度。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 32.08,
   "dur": 5.44,
   "speechStart": 32.177,
   "speechEnd": 37.307
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "它要上链，要花 Gas。",
   "spoken": "它要上链，要花 Gas。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 37.74,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 37.74,
   "speechEnd": 39.553
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "第二类，permit，效果和 approve 一样，但只是一个链下签名。",
   "spoken": "第二类，permit，效果和 approve 一样，但只是一个链下签名。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 39.96,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 40.053,
   "speechEnd": 45.098
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "签好的消息，由别人提交上链。",
   "spoken": "签好的消息，由别人提交上链。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 45.54,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 45.632,
   "speechEnd": 48.104
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "第三类，setApprovalForAll，对方能转走你在一个 NFT 系列里的全部 NFT。",
   "spoken": "第三类，setApprovalForAll，对方能转走你在一个 NFT 系列里的全部 NFT。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 48.56,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 48.666,
   "speechEnd": 55.304
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "第四类，Permit2 批量授权，一次签名，交出多种代币。",
   "spoken": "第四类，Permit2 批亮授权，一次签名，交出多种代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 55.74,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 55.74,
   "speechEnd": 60.197
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "第五类，EIP-7702 委托，你的地址去执行一份委托合约的代码。",
   "spoken": "第五类，EIP-7702 委托，你的地址去执行一份委托合约的代码。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 60.6,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 60.697,
   "speechEnd": 67.045
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "那份代码，可以直接转走全部资产。",
   "spoken": "那份代码，可以直接转走全部资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 67.46,
   "dur": 2.88,
   "speechStart": 67.46,
   "speechEnd": 70.18
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "最危险的是链下签名，不花 Gas，钱包里也没有交易记录。",
   "spoken": "最危险的是链下签名，不花 Gas，钱包里也没有交易记录。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 70.56,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 70.56,
   "speechEnd": 75.421
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "你以为只是登录，其实签下一张支票。",
   "spoken": "你以为只是登录，其实签下一张支票。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 75.82,
   "dur": 3.36,
   "speechStart": 75.918,
   "speechEnd": 78.922
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "2024 年 9 月，有人签了一个 permit，被转走约 3243 万美元的 spWETH。",
   "spoken": "2024 年 9 月，有人签了一个 permit，被转走约 3243 万美元的 spWETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 79.4,
   "dur": 8.32,
   "speechStart": 79.505,
   "speechEnd": 87.519
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "同年 8 月，另一名用户的签名，把金库合约的 owner 改成攻击者。",
   "spoken": "同年 8 月，另一名用户的签名，把金库合约的 owner 改成攻击者。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 87.94,
   "dur": 5.6,
   "speechStart": 87.94,
   "speechEnd": 93.343
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "约 20 分钟后，攻击者铸出约 5547 万美元的 DAI。",
   "spoken": "约 20 分钟后，攻击者铸出约 5547 万美元的 DAI。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-20.wav",
   "start": 93.76,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 93.858,
   "speechEnd": 98.833
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
   "text": "这一例不是 permit，是改 owner。",
   "spoken": "这一例不是 permit，是改 owner。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-21.wav",
   "start": 99.26,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 99.356,
   "speechEnd": 101.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-22",
   "text": "链下签名不上链，也能转移资产。",
   "spoken": "链下签名不上链，也能转移资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-22.wav",
   "start": 102.12,
   "dur": 3.12,
   "speechStart": 102.12,
   "speechEnd": 105.01
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-23",
   "text": "2025 年 8 月，又有两起 7702 委托钓鱼，分别约 154 万和 100 万美元。",
   "spoken": "2025 年 8 月，又有两起 7702 委托钓鱼，分别约 154 万和 100 万美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-23.wav",
   "start": 105.46,
   "dur": 7.36,
   "speechStart": 105.567,
   "speechEnd": 112.627
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-24",
   "text": "也有研究者认为，这两起的根因仍是私钥泄露，委托只是让转账更快。",
   "spoken": "也有研究者认为，这两起的根因仍是私钥泄露，委托只是让转账更快。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep19/audio/lines/seg2-24.wav",
   "start": 113.04,
   "dur": 6.0,
   "speechStart": 113.138,
   "speechEnd": 118.872
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-25",
   "text": "大额地址的签名，要在可信设备上逐字段解码。",
   "spoken": "大额地址的签名，要在可信设备上逐字段解码。",
